.Dd March 12, 2026
.Dt PCI_IOMAP 9
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm pci_iomap
.Nd map the MMIO range described by a PCI BAR
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In kern/pci.h
.Ft void *
.Fn pci_iomap "pci_device_t *dev" "int bar" "size_t max_len"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn pci_iomap
function reserves the selected MMIO BAR if necessary and maps it through the
kernel
.Fn ioremap
API.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns the mapped kernel pointer on success or
.Dv NULL
on failure.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ioremap 9 ,
.Xr pci_request_region 9
